<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0031.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "85.578mm" ver = "01" gw = "332" gh = "226"/>
</figure>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9B06010001">
<title>
General Notes
</title>
<ptxt>
Welding method and number of welding points are the same on both sides. This repair instruction shows procedure for left side.
</ptxt>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9B06010002">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
Welding spots (1) for apron side outer member (2) and dash lower member (3) are covered with dash lower outer extension (4). Remove dash lower outer extension before removing apron side outer member.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0032.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "72.379mm" ver = "01" gw = "229" gh = "189"/>
</figure>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove dash lower outer extension.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0B9B0014.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "81.960mm" ver = "01" gw = "491" gh = "216"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.968in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[B]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Vehicle inside
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drill out welding spots and remove apron side member and apron side outer member.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0034.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "97.525mm" ver = "02" gw = "466" gh = "260"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9B06010003">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s).
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Front body: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9B04004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Underbody: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9B04008"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Perform repair while taking into consideration installation of parts that affect appearance. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9B04003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install apron side outer member.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0035.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "137.586mm" ver = "02" gw = "478" gh = "373"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
