</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install apron side member and apron side outer member.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld, plug weld and continuous weld.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9B0036.jpg" width = "183.000mm" height = "97.525mm" ver = "02" gw = "466" gh = "260"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install dash lower outer extension.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
